        <span class="art-cat">Jewellery</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="art-h1">Lending against Argyle pink diamonds</h1>
      <p class="art-lead">
        The mine has closed and the supply is finite — but a lender still assesses one stone at a
        time. What has to be established about identity, colour, documentation and demand before an
        Argyle pink diamond can be considered as loan security.
      </p>
      <div class="art-byline">
        <div class="art-author">
          <Image class="art-avatar" src={specialistImg} alt="" widths={[42, 84]} sizes="42px" format="webp" quality={80} />
